WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.820
The primary effect of these brutal green energy policies has not been to help the environment,

00:06.820 --> 00:12.100
but to redistribute manufacturing and industrial activity from developed countries that follow

00:12.100 --> 00:19.740
the insane rules that are put down to polluting countries that break the rules and are making

00:19.740 --> 00:20.740
a fortune.

00:20.740 --> 00:21.640
They're making a fortune.

